  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be completed before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Prior Approval Statement [dated April 2021]- prepared by Sam Planning Services, PR-L00, PR-P001, PR-P002, PR-P003, PR-E001, PR-E002, PR-E003, PR-S001, EX-E001, EX-E002, EX-E003, EX-L001, EX-P001, EX-P002, EX-P003, EX-S001; all received on 05/04/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The development shall not be occupied until arrangements have been agreed in writing with the local planning authority and put in place to ensure that, with the exception of disabled persons, no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the area at any time.",
    "Condition : 4 - The approved cycle storage facilities shall be fully implemented and made available for use before any part of the development is first occupied and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction."
